# Practical Systems Lab does not require any environment variables to run.
#
# All curriculum content is source-controlled TypeScript, and all learner
# progress is stored in the browser via localStorage. There is no database,
# no API keys, and no external services.
#
# This file exists only to document that fact, and to give you a safe place
# to add placeholders if you fork the project and add integrations.
#
# Example (unused):
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_NAME="Practical Systems Lab"
